{"title":"Rookie but One-In-A-Million Actor","synopsis":"Mooyoung menghabiskan masa kecilnya di bawah tekanan ayah tirinya yang keras, sebuah kehidupan yang terasa seperti hidup di neraka. Sebuah suara misterius di neraka menunjukkan kepadanya cara untuk bertahan hidup. “Jalani hidup orang lain, bukan hidupmu.” Begitulah perjalanan aktingnya dimulai… Apakah itu naluri bertahan hidup? Bahkan ketika dia melakukannya dengan baik, dia terlalu unggul. Melalui akting, Mooyoung memperoleh kehidupan baru. Ini adalah kisah Mooyoung, seorang jenius akting yang luar biasa, yang memulai tantangan di industri hiburan!","alternative_title":"신인인데 천만배우","author":"Baeppu, Choelos","artist":"Jibin","genres":["Drama","Shounen","Supernatural"],"chapters":[{"id":"fe42aeae-5e61-4223-bada-85b5e22267d2","number":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"be03e17f-fac2-4e4e-af28-5ba65a4208f7","number":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"527b0453-7092-4bad-952a-7ccaa4164d5b","number":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"id":"abb0899c-cf08-4bf9-945c-d53c8163d733","number":"87","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"id":"e7d6f280-e53c-486b-8a15-ac874cf26f71","number":"86","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"id":"af042e85-60fd-4415-a9fa-56468ffbdecd","number":"85","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"id":"480a9c9a-b922-4859-a7fb-4622a7c2ca00","number":"84","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2026-05-25","images":[]},{"id":"01ddc9e0-6c6a-46ec-873f-d1c65ce134da","number":"83","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2026-05-18","images":[]},{"id":"aa3254cb-d448-49e3-95b5-9558daa42542","number":"82","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"id":"0b16b2c9-a0d5-4fb1-b8a0-fb5a1445b2fb","number":"81","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2026-04-26","images":[]},{"id":"1c6b6e03-f435-40af-8f1d-7dafc7bf2f22","number":"80","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2026-04-13","images":[]},{"id":"11e5